The `plugins/teams/` subtree ports parts of OpenClaw's Microsoft Teams extension
(https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/tree/main/extensions/msteams, @openclaw/msteams
2026.10.10): the Bot Framework service-URL and Microsoft file-host allowlists
(plugins/teams/hosts.ts) and the file-consent / file-info card shapes and
card-submit reading (plugins/teams/cards.ts).
